@startuml seq-1-destination-search
' UC1: Search a destination  (client-side fuzzy autocomplete + submit)
title UC1 — Destination Search & Autocomplete
autonumber

actor Guest
participant "SearchForm\n<<client>>" as Form
participant "DestinationAutocomplete\n<<client>>" as AC
participant "FuzzySearch\n(MiniSearch)" as Fuzzy
participant "Static asset\n/destinations-index.json" as Index
participant "Next.js Router" as Router

== Index bootstrap (on mount) ==
AC -> Index : fetch("/destinations-index.json")
Index --> AC : DestinationEntry[]
AC -> Fuzzy : buildIndex(entries)
note right of Fuzzy : dedupes repeated uids\n(prefix + fuzzy 0.2)
Fuzzy --> AC : MiniSearch index

== Type-ahead (sub-100ms, fully client-side) ==
Guest -> AC : type "singa"
AC -> Fuzzy : searchDestinations(index, "singa", 8)
Fuzzy --> AC : DestinationEntry[] (ranked)
AC --> Guest : render suggestion listbox
Guest -> AC : click "Singapore, Singapore"
AC -> Form : onSelect(entry)
note over AC, Form : onTopMatchChange also fires while typing,\nso a typed place + Search works without a click

== Submit ==
Guest -> Form : pick dates, rooms, adults/children (GuestSelector), click Search
alt no destination picked
  Form --> Guest : "Please enter and pick a destination."
end
Form -> Form : validateDates(checkin, checkout, now)
alt invalid (checkin < 3 days out, or checkout <= checkin)
  Form --> Guest : show inline error (role="alert")
else valid
  note right of Form : upstream takes one occupancy count per room,\nso guests = adults + children
  Form -> Router : push("/search?destination_id=..&checkin=..&checkout=..&rooms=..&guests=..&currency=SGD&country_code=SG&lang=en_US")
  Router --> Guest : navigate to results page (UC2)
end
@enduml
